{
  "key": 58411,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Elder: You showed us what you’ve got,\n",
        "and it is indeed good...\r",
        "Take this elemental stone.\r",
        "However, you should care more about\n",
        "your Pokémon.\r",
        "The way you treat your Pokémon can\n",
        "be too harsh...\r",
        "Remember, Pokémon are not tools\n",
        "of war...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...\r",
        "...Humph!\n",
        "He calls himself the Elder, but he was\f",
        "no match for me.\r",
        "Sure enough, those who lecture how\n",
        "you should be “nice” to Pokémon...\f",
        "They cannot defeat me.\r",
        "All I care about are strong Pokémon\n",
        "that win every time.\r",
        "The rest of them don’t mean anything\n",
        "to me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} used\n",
        "an Escape Rope!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "So good of you to come here!\r",
        "Sprout Tower is a place of training.\n",
        "People and Pokémon test their bonds\f",
        "to build a bright future together.\f",
        "I am the final test.\r",
        "Allow me to check the ties between\n",
        "you and your Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmmm...\n",
        "The way you battle is quite elegant.\r",
        "You should be able to stand up\n",
        "to Falkner.\r",
        "Let me offer you a reward...\r",
        "Tell me, what is your favourite\n",
        "evolution of Eevee?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I hope you learn and grow from\n",
        "your journey."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I hope you learn and grow from\n",
        "your journey."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s a powerful painting of a\n",
        "Bellsprout."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "A Pokémon statue...\n",
        "It looks very distinguished."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00009",
      "en_US": "Vaporeon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00010",
      "en_US": "Jolteon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00011",
      "en_US": "Flareon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00012",
      "en_US": "Espeon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00013",
      "en_US": "Umbreon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00014",
      "en_US": "Leafeon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00015",
      "en_US": "Glaceon"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I see.\n",
        "Then you should take this!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00017",
      "en_US": "None"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Really?\r",
        "Please, you must have one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0056_D15R0103_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, and please, take this as well.\n",
        "It’s a TM containing a move known\f",
        "as Flash.\r",
        "It will light your way in dark caverns.\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
